{"ref":"BDB, רָקִיק","hw":"רָקִיק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָקִיק</span></big>  <strong>n.m. a thin cake</strong>, (RV) <strong>wafer (</strong>cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">رُقَاقَةٌ</span> <em>a thin round cake of bread</em><strong>)</strong>, always of unleavened bread: <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:23\" href=\"/Exodus.29.23\">Ex 29:23</a> = <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.26\">Lv 8:26</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ אֶחָד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְקִיק מַצָּה אֶחָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:19\" href=\"/Numbers.6.19\">Nu 6:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְקִיקֵי מַצּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:2\" href=\"/Exodus.29.2\">Ex 29:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.4\">Lv 2:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.12\">7:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:15\" href=\"/Numbers.6.15\">Nu 6:15</a> (all P), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.29\">1 Ch 23:29</a>.—𝔊 λάγανον.","next":"BDB, רַקָּה²","prev":"BDB, רַק²"}